      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，旺紫丁展示了自己在英里赛的实力，\n将一份切实的荣耀抓在手里――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5f0588f558a194a7bf0bd99d105b881ee9eee53083057224107818cc4482db3",
