      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……说起来，\n今年的『伊丽莎白女王杯』\n是在阪神比赛场举办的对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "669330c3cf50bcd31c143c308dccb2902978ff31232c5c119b0d6d0ce910013b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130318.json",
      "json_path": [
